### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Valid submission
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "emp_123",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "category": "meals",
  "description": "Client lunch meeting",
  "expense_date": "2026-09-01"
}

### Invalid submission (bad category, should fail with 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "emp_123",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "category": "snacks",
  "description": "Client lunch meeting",
  "expense_date": "2026-09-01"
}

### Test 1: Small amount — should auto-approve
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "emp_1",
  "amount": 20,
  "category": "meals",
  "description": "Team lunch outing",
  "expense_date": "2026-09-01"
}

### Test 2: Mid-range with receipt — should need AI review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "emp_1",
  "amount": 300,
  "category": "travel",
  "description": "Client site visit travel",
  "expense_date": "2026-09-01",
  "receipt_url": "http://example.com/receipt1.pdf"
}

### Test 3: Huge amount — should auto-reject
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "emp_1",
  "amount": 6000,
  "category": "travel",
  "description": "Company retreat booking",
  "expense_date": "2026-09-01",
  "receipt_url": "http://example.com/receipt2.pdf"
}